{"id":"17034fdfe7fbba71","group":"89","path":"89/89-thm-glb-letterless-normal-form.md","title":"Effective Letterless Normal Form Theorem for GLB","display":"thm-glb-letterless-normal-form — Effective Letterless Normal Form Theorem for GLB","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-thm-glb-letterless-normal-form","aliases":["89-thm-glb-letterless-normal-form"],"display":"thm-glb-letterless-normal-form — Effective Letterless Normal Form Theorem for GLB","depends_on":["[[89-lem-glb-nice-normalization]]","[[89-lem-glb-normal-box-reduction]]","[[89-df-glb-logic]]","[[89-df-glb-letterless-normal-form]]"],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-thm-glb-letterless-normal-form"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-thm-glb-letterless-normal-form</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-glb-letterless-normal-form — Effective Letterless Normal Form Theorem for GLB"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6e228478af514c07\" href=\"?note=6e228478af514c07\" title=\"89-lem-glb-nice-normalization\">89-lem-glb-nice-normalization</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0413066aa327a245\" href=\"?note=0413066aa327a245\" title=\"89-lem-glb-normal-box-reduction\">89-lem-glb-normal-box-reduction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5a9efa2261b8f73c\" href=\"?note=5a9efa2261b8f73c\" title=\"89-df-glb-logic\">89-df-glb-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e82c18eddcbe3ca2\" href=\"?note=e82c18eddcbe3ca2\" title=\"89-df-glb-letterless-normal-form\">89-df-glb-letterless-normal-form</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GLB}\">\\(\\mathrm{GLB}\\)</span> 是双模态定理集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ev}:\\mathsf{Expr}_B\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}\">\\(\\mathrm{ev}:\\mathsf{Expr}_B\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}\\)</span> 是 nice presentation 的结构翻译。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{LL}_B\">\\(\\mathsf{LL}_B\\)</span> 为无字母双模态公式集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Expr}_B\">\\(\\mathsf{Expr}_B\\)</span> 是有限 nice presentations。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Comp}\">\\(\\operatorname{Comp}\\)</span> 采用普通有限树算法的含义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}glb\\text{-}letterless\\text{-}normal\\text{-}form}\\vdash\n\\exists f:\\mathsf{LL}_B\\to\\mathsf{Expr}_B\\\n\\bigl[\\operatorname{Comp}(f)\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathsf{LL}_B\\\n(A\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ev}(f(A)))\\in\\mathrm{GLB}\\bigr].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}glb\\text{-}letterless\\text{-}normal\\text{-}form}\\vdash\n\\exists f:\\mathsf{LL}_B\\to\\mathsf{Expr}_B\\\n\\bigl[\\operatorname{Comp}(f)\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathsf{LL}_B\\\n(A\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ev}(f(A)))\\in\\mathrm{GLB}\\bigr].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 16 章 pp.212–217，Ignatiev 无字母正规形定理。印刷页 p 对应 PDF 第 p+39 页。</p>\n<p>按输入公式结构构造算法。底直接用 nice 的底标签；否定、合取先递归构造 nice presentation，再布尔连接。遇到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box_iB\">\\(\\Box_iB\\)</span>，先对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 的 nice presentation 用 Stage 1 正规化，再把盒分配到每个子句，对各记录用 Stage 2 的对应一行，得到新的有限 nice presentation；空合取返回 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\top\">\\(\\top\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>每次主递归都进入真子公式；CNF 和序数码操作都是有限算法，所以总可计算。各步 GLB 等价由两条阶段引理与正规性保证。这是 Ignatiev 的正常形式算法；它将“存在某等价式”加强为一个有效输出函数。</p>\n<p>输出可以非常长，不据此宣称多项式复杂度；该正规形也不声称唯一。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-lem-glb-nice-normalization","status":"resolved","id":"6e228478af514c07","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-lem-glb-nice-normalization]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-lem-glb-normal-box-reduction","status":"resolved","id":"0413066aa327a245","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-lem-glb-normal-box-reduction]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-glb-logic","status":"resolved","id":"5a9efa2261b8f73c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-glb-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-glb-letterless-normal-form","status":"resolved","id":"e82c18eddcbe3ca2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-glb-letterless-normal-form]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{GLB}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ev}:\\mathsf{Expr}_B\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{LL}_B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Expr}_B","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Comp}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}glb\\text{-}letterless\\text{-}normal\\text{-}form}\\vdash\n\\exists f:\\mathsf{LL}_B\\to\\mathsf{Expr}_B\\\n\\bigl[\\operatorname{Comp}(f)\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathsf{LL}_B\\\n(A\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ev}(f(A)))\\in\\mathrm{GLB}\\bigr].","display":true},{"tex":"\\Box_iB","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"\\top","display":false}],"bytes":2035,"backlinks":[{"id":"b7d6bfa12e121880","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"05a599f85e508061","anchor":"ref-94","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-lem-glb-nice-normalization]]、[[89-thm-glb-letterless-normal-form]]、[[89-cor-glb-letterless-truth-decision]]"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-197","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"正规化：[[89-df-glb-letterless-normal-form]] → [[89-lem-glb-nice-normalization]] → [[89-lem-glb-second-box-boolean]] → [[89-lem-glb-normal-box-reduction]] → [[89-thm-glb-letterless-normal-form]] → [[89-cor-glb-letterless-truth-decision]]。算例：[[89-ex-glb-normal-form-reduction]]。"}],"outgoing":["6e228478af514c07","0413066aa327a245","5a9efa2261b8f73c","e82c18eddcbe3ca2"]}